"""Question-led medical interpretation. Presentation only; no inference or refitting."""
from pathlib import Path
import re,csv,shutil
from .medical_comparison import bi,p,h,frame,main_body
R=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2]
def block(titlez,titlee,z,e):
 return '<section class="panel">'+h(titlez,titlee)+p(z,e)+'</section>'
def apply(S):
 S=Path(S)
 intro=h('医学迁移：目前能回答什么？','Medical transfer: what can we conclude?',1)+p('当前结论：流程已跑通；SAM 的医学分割质量尚未验证；已有征象关联是探索性证据，尚不能把概念命名为医学征象。','Current conclusion: the pipeline runs; medical segmentation quality remains unvalidated; available sign associations are exploratory and do not establish medical concept identities.','lead')
 intro+=block('1 · SAM 能高质量分割皮肤镜图像吗？','1 · Does SAM segment dermoscopic images well?', '目前不能下这个结论。HAM 路线的101图产生2886个原始SAM候选，HU-MCD后处理为423个区域，其中351个非零特征区域用于拟合。它证明SAM参与了区域生成，不证明边界准确、病灶完整或医学征象被正确分离。72个非空区域产生零特征，是后续表示问题的观察，不能直接判为SAM失败。','Not established. On 101 images, SAM produced 2,886 candidates; HU-MCD postprocessing yielded 423 regions, of which 351 had nonzero features for fitting. This demonstrates region generation, not accurate boundaries, complete lesions or correct separation of medical signs. The 72 nonempty regions with zero features are an observation about downstream representation, not direct evidence of SAM failure.')
 intro+=p('“分割好”须先确定对象：完整病灶边界，还是色素网络、点球等局部征象。两者需要不同的参考标注。现有验收没有提供对应的专家像素真值，因此不能报告医学Dice/IoU；SAM自带predicted_iou也不是真值IoU。我们也没有无SAM对照来证明其增益。','“Good segmentation” needs a target: the whole lesion boundary, or local signs such as pigment networks and dots/globules. These require different reference annotations. Current acceptance provides no matching expert pixel ground truth, so medical Dice/IoU cannot be reported. SAM predicted_iou is not measured ground-truth IoU. No no-SAM comparison establishes its benefit.','note')
 intro+=block('2 · 概念与七点医学征象有关吗？','2 · Are concepts associated with seven-point signs?', '旧 DermaMNIST-C 路线已将冻结概念应用到101例MEL，完成12项学习概念覆盖率对照及单列的12项补空间对照。它问的是：带某种征象的图片，分配给该概念的区域占比是否不同？它没有检验概念是否等于该征象、选区是否位于征象处，或是否改善诊断。HAM路线发现3个概念，但征象关联尚未运行。','The earlier DermaMNIST-C route applied frozen concepts to 101 MEL cases and completed 12 learned-concept coverage contrasts plus 12 separately reported complement contrasts. The question is whether images carrying a sign have different area coverage assigned to the concept. This does not test semantic identity, spatial overlap with the sign, or diagnostic benefit. The HAM route found three concepts; its sign associations have not been computed.')
 rows=list(csv.DictReader((R/'artifacts/bunya/medical-external-results-20260923/contrasts.csv').open()))
 intro+=p('下面完整列出旧路线唯一学习概念的12项比较，避免只展示最有利结果。覆盖率为分配到该概念的有效掩码并集／整图面积；差值为征象组减缺失组。AUC固定以“覆盖越高→所列征象组”为方向，不反向优化。无p值或独立验证。','All 12 comparisons for the earlier route’s single learned concept are shown below, without selecting favourable results. Coverage is the union of effective masks assigned to that concept divided by image area. Differences are sign-group minus absent-group. AUC keeps the fixed direction “higher coverage → named sign group”; directions are not reversed. No p-values or independent confirmation are supplied.')
 intro+='<div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr>'+''.join('<th>'+bi(z,e)+'</th>' for z,e in [('征象 / 组','Sign / group'),('组 / 缺失 数量','Group / absent n'),('平均覆盖率差（百分点）','Mean coverage difference (pp)'),('描述性AUC','Descriptive AUC')])+'</tr></thead><tbody>'
 for r in rows:
  if r['is_complement']!='False':continue
  intro+='<tr><td>'+r['sign']+' · '+r['group']+'</td><td>'+r['group_n']+' / '+r['reference_n']+'</td><td>'+f"{100*float(r['mean_difference']):+.2f}"+'</td><td>'+f"{float(r['auc']):.3f}"+'</td></tr>'
 intro+='</tbody></table></div>'+p('TYP典型；ATP非典型；REG规则；IR不规则；PRS存在；ABS缺失。两项REG只有1例，不能作为稳定关联证据。不规则点球84例对12例缺失的覆盖差为+19.77百分点、AUC0.660，可作为待核实线索；这不是“发现了点球概念”的证明。','TYP typical; ATP atypical; REG regular; IR irregular; PRS present; ABS absent. Two REG groups contain only one case and cannot establish a stable association. Irregular dots/globules (84 versus 12 absent) show +19.77 pp coverage and AUC 0.660: a hypothesis to investigate, not proof of a dots/globules concept.')
 intro+=block('3 · 两条实验中，什么是真正的 external evaluation？','3 · What is external evaluation in these experiments?', '旧路线：源域拟合概念→Derm7pt应用冻结概念，符合跨数据集评价结构，但相似候选审阅和身份限制仍需披露。新路线：HAM训练分类器→在Derm7pt全部101例上拟合概念；Derm7pt对分类器是外部来源，对概念却是拟合集。它是医学概念发现可行性实验，不是独立的概念泛化验证。','Earlier route: source-domain concept fitting → frozen application to Derm7pt. This is a cross-dataset evaluation design, with unresolved similarity review and identity limitations. New route: HAM-trained classifier → concept fitting on all 101 Derm7pt cases. Derm7pt is external to classifier training but is the concept-fitting set. This is a medical concept-discovery feasibility study, not independent concept-generalization validation.')
 intro+=block('4 · 数据组合和自训练分类器合理吗？','4 · Are the data combination and self-trained classifier sensible?', '针对跨数据集迁移，HAM训练＋Derm7pt评价是合理设计，不能声称两者已完全独立。DermaMNIST-C与HAM在本项目使用相同源图片身份，并非两个独立医学数据集。Derm7pt-only可减少数据域差异，但仍需分离训练／发现／评价角色，而且回答的是域内问题。保留HAM分类器、只在Derm7pt做发现，并不等于Derm7pt-only训练。','HAM training plus Derm7pt evaluation is sensible for cross-dataset transfer, without asserting complete independence. DermaMNIST-C and HAM share source-image identities here; they are not independent medical cohorts. A Derm7pt-only pilot reduces dataset-domain differences but still needs separated training/discovery/evaluation roles and answers a within-domain question. Keeping a HAM classifier while discovering on Derm7pt is not Derm7pt-only training.')
 intro+=p('从ImageNet初始化自训练ResNet50是合理且已经完成的可追溯选择：配置、划分、checkpoint与验收可查。HAM分类器选中epoch27，源测试MEL为45/70，Derm7pt为34/101；后者是未遮挡全图预测，不能归咎于SAM。单seed和这些结果不证明临床可用性或最优训练。','ImageNet-initialized ResNet50 fine-tuning is a reasonable, already completed, traceable choice: configuration, splits, checkpoint and acceptance are recorded. The HAM classifier selected epoch 27: MEL results are 45/70 on the source test and 34/101 on Derm7pt. The latter uses unmasked full images and cannot be attributed to SAM. One seed and these results do not establish clinical utility or optimal training.')
 intro+=block('5 · 有什么标注？没有医生审阅可以解释到哪一步？','5 · What annotations exist, and what can we interpret without clinicians?', 'Derm7pt作者提供诊断与七点征象标签；本次分析使用每张图对应的类别标签，不是像素区域标注。当前已验收材料没有可用于评估病灶边界或色素征象位置的专家像素真值；不能用SAM生成的掩码充当真值。这不等于断言所有相关公开资源都不存在此类标注。','Derm7pt provides diagnosis and seven-point sign labels. This analysis uses image-associated categorical labels, not pixel annotations. Current accepted material supplies no expert pixel ground truth for lesion boundaries or pigment-sign locations; SAM-generated masks cannot substitute for it. This does not assert that such annotations are absent from every related public resource.')
 intro+=p('没有医生审阅时，可以描述选区、模型分配、图片级关联和统计限制；不能确认“这是某医学征象”、病理机制或临床可靠性。此前9例基础视觉审阅不覆盖全部101例，也不是医学标签验证。','Without clinician review we can describe regions, model assignments, image-level associations and statistical limits. We cannot confirm medical sign identities, pathological mechanisms or clinical reliability. The earlier basic visual review of nine cases neither covers all 101 cases nor validates medical labels.')
 intro+=p('来源：<a href="https://github.com/jeremykawahara/derm7pt">作者数据加载说明</a>；<a href="https://derm.cs.sfu.ca/Welcome.html">官方数据说明</a>。外部链接仅作参考；本页结论与数据离线可读。','Sources: <a href="https://github.com/jeremykawahara/derm7pt">author dataset/loading documentation</a>; <a href="https://derm.cs.sfu.ca/Welcome.html">official dataset description</a>. External links are references; this page’s conclusions and data remain readable offline.')
 intro+=block('现在真正缺少的证据','Evidence still missing', '数据准备、身份核对和分类器来源已有验收，不再笼统列为未完成。仍有214个相似候选对涉及20个R101病例待审阅，患者独立性不能确认。要回答SAM质量，需要明确目标并有专家标注／审阅；要回答医学概念关联，需要HAM路线的征象分析及独立验证设计。以上均不是本轮新增实验授权。','Data preparation, identity checks and classifier provenance have acceptance records and are no longer blanket unfinished blockers. Review remains pending for 214 similarity candidates involving 20 R101 cases; patient independence is unconfirmed. SAM quality requires a defined target and expert references/review. Medical concept associations require HAM sign analysis and an independent validation design. None of these constitutes authorization for a new experiment.')
 f=S/'medical.html';s=f.read_text();body=main_body(s);body=re.sub(r'<!-- MEDICAL-QUESTIONS -->.*?<!-- /MEDICAL-QUESTIONS -->','',body,flags=re.S)
 body=re.sub(r'<h1>.*?</h1>','',body,count=1,flags=re.S)
 f.write_text(frame(s,'<!-- MEDICAL-QUESTIONS -->'+intro+'<!-- /MEDICAL-QUESTIONS -->'+h('实验明细与原始证据入口','Experiment details and evidence')+body,'Medical transfer · Research questions'))
 for name,isham in [('medical-ham-derm/index.html',True),('medical-dermamnist.html',False)]:
  f=S/name;s=f.read_text();s=re.sub(r'<!-- QUESTION-GUIDE -->.*?<!-- /QUESTION-GUIDE -->','',s,flags=re.S)
  guide=h('先明确这页回答什么','What this page can answer',2)+p('此页展示：SAM提出了哪些区域、HU-MCD怎样重组和分配它们。它不是医学分割质量评分，也不是已确认的医学概念库。'+('101例全部参与拟合，无独立概念验证；征象关联尚未运行。' if isham else '已有征象对照是图片级描述性关联，不是空间定位。'),'This page shows which regions SAM proposed and how HU-MCD processed and assigned them. It is neither a medical segmentation quality score nor a validated medical concept atlas. '+('All 101 cases participated in fitting; no held-out concept validation or sign-association analysis is available.' if isham else 'The completed sign contrasts describe image-level associations, not spatial localization.'))+p('<a href="'+('../' if isham else '')+'medical.html">先读研究问题、结论和证据边界 →</a>','<a href="'+('../' if isham else '')+'medical.html">Read the research questions, conclusions and evidence limits →</a>')
  s=re.sub(r'(</h1>)',r'\1<!-- QUESTION-GUIDE -->'+guide+'<!-- /QUESTION-GUIDE -->',s,count=1)
  if isham:
   s=re.sub(r'(<details class="question-trace"><summary>.*?</summary>)(<!-- MEDICAL-WALKTHROUGH -->.*?<!-- /MEDICAL-WALKTHROUGH -->)</details>',r'\2',s,flags=re.S)
   s=re.sub(r'(<!-- MEDICAL-WALKTHROUGH -->.*?<!-- /MEDICAL-WALKTHROUGH -->)',lambda m:'<details class="question-trace"><summary>'+bi('证据A：展开两例区域生成过程（非质量评估）','Evidence A: inspect region generation in two cases (not quality assessment)')+'</summary>'+m[1]+'</details>',s,flags=re.S)
  f.write_text(s)
 return {'new_predictions':0,'question_led':True,'source':'accepted results and official Derm7pt documentation'}
